From 67e1213695f34d85d271dd4fd8a3e678836f46de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:16:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] holdsDoors: presets, the gate fill, schema and validator
 (slice 9.1 step 5)

NpcHabits gains holdsDoors (low and medium true, high false) and expand! writes
gate.noHold: the openFor NPCs whose expanded holdsDoors is false, on gates with no
playerMayPassIf and no authored noHold. The report gives each NPC's gates. The schema
takes habits.holdsDoors and gate.noHold; the validator warns on holdsDoors false by name
that does nothing and on an authored noHold naming an id outside openFor, and the habits
report lists each gate.
